<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>软路由 on Mi&amp;Bee Blog</title><link>https://blog.mickeyzzc.tech/tags/%E8%BD%AF%E8%B7%AF%E7%94%B1/</link><description>Recent content in 软路由 on Mi&amp;Bee Blog</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>蓝宝石的傻话</managingEditor><lastBuildDate>Fri, 18 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.mickeyzzc.tech/tags/%E8%BD%AF%E8%B7%AF%E7%94%B1/rss.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>MiBeeSteward 装在哪：软路由、主机、center+agent 实测对比</title><link>https://blog.mickeyzzc.tech/posts/mibee-oss/mibeesteward-deploy-form-comparison/</link><pubDate>Fri, 18 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blog.mickeyzzc.tech/posts/mibee-oss/mibeesteward-deploy-form-comparison/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;MiBeeSteward（&lt;a href="https://github.com/Mi-Bee-Studio/MiBeeSteward"&gt;GitHub&lt;/a&gt;，AGPLv3，Go 单二进制）做设备层的自动发现、识别和资产登记，支持三种部署形态：直接跑在软路由上、跑在网内一台主机上、多网段时用一台 center 带若干轻量 agent。三种形态在扫描能力、被动发现视野和资源开销上差别在哪，本文在同一套环境里做了受控实测。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>